648\u062f\u0639", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 Tools Used", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "en_golden_rules", "label": "Golden Rules (English \u00a70)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a70, lines 7-19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stay inside 3-5 core features \u00b7 demo data only \u00b7 plan mode before building \u00b7 review by using the product not reading its code \u00b7 context7 for current docs \u00b7 commit daily \u00b7 one doc language."}, {"id": "en_requirements_standard", "label": "Requirements Standard (English \u00a71)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a71, lines 20-36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defers to requirements-standards.md and summarizes EARS patterns, flat FR-/NFR- ids, user stories, Gherkin acceptance criteria, and the Necessary/Atomic/Verifiable/Clear check."}, {"id": "en_journey_decision_format", "label": "JOURNEY / DECISION text format (English \u00a72)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, lines 37-65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same structure as the Arabic \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u062d\u0651\u062f\u0629 but with English keywords (JOURNEY/ACTOR/START/DECISION/END); Claude must rewrite the trainee's raw description into it without dropping any step."}, {"id": "en_six_day_flow", "label": "The 6-Day Flow (English \u00a73)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a73, lines 66-124", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Day 1 requirements & scope \u00b7 Day 2 UX plan \u00b7 Day 3 foundation \u00b7 Day 4 core function \u00b7 Day 5 integration & hardening \u00b7 Day 6 deploy & present \u2014 each day ~1h concepts + 1h with trainer + 3h building + 1h review."}, {"id": "en_tools_table", "label": "Tools Used table (English \u00a75)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a75, lines 138-154", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Claude Code \u00b7 context7 \u00b7 draw.io skill \u00b7 Claude Design \u00b7 GitHub MCP \u00b7 chrome-devtools MCP \u00b7 Vercel \u2014 kept as a live table filled in as the bootcamp progresses."}, {"id": "en_default_stack", "label": "Default Tech Stack & Project Setup (English \u00a76)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a76, lines 155-167", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One full-stack Next.js (TS) app in a single app/ folder \u2014 no frontend/backend split \u2014 plus hosted Supabase (Postgres + built-in auth, no Docker) and a Vercel deploy; the trainee only creates accounts and pastes keys."}, {"id": "en_testing_three_layers", "label": "How Claude Works While Building \u2014 build, test, report (English \u00a77)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "\u00a77, lines 168-177", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same three testing layers as the Arabic skill (re-runnable automated tests, CLI exercise of server functions, chrome-devtools browser walkthrough), plus the plain-language 'What we'll build now' summary, mandatory password hashing, and explicit server shutdown after testing."}, {"id": "en_deploy_vercel", 